  m_Name: Note07_Assessment
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ItemData
  itemName: Howard Clark - Subject 003 assessment
  itemDescription: Custodian of S4
  fullNoteContent: "Howard Clark is an unusual man, he spends essentially all of
    his time here just sitting in the security office never really leaving to talk
    to anybody.\n\nInstead he just sits in his office and watches everything, which,
    I suppose, you could argue is a good thing for us since rarely anything slips
    past him and his reports are always the most thorough since he sees basically
    everything that happens here.\n\nOn the rare occasion he does leave or has to
    work with other security personnel, he is not concerned with what others do or
    say and he just does his own thing, more often than not he sort of defaults into
    the \u201Cleader\u201D of the room.\n\nAside from that nothing else about him
    stands out, his physical assessments show he is perfectly healthy with no history
    of medical issues, and despite his reluctance to speak during his psychological
    assessments, I think his behaviour, as outlined above, tells us all we need to
    know.\n\n- Assessment by Dr. Olivier Matthews"
  type: 0
  icon: {fileID: 0}
